sequenceDiagram
    actor NOC as NOC
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant Device as Perangkat Jaringan

    Note over NOC,Device: HKN-005: Menguji Koneksi SSH ke Perangkat

    NOC->>FE: Klik "Test Koneksi SSH"
    activate FE
    FE->>BE: POST /api/devices/{id}/test-connection
    activate BE
    BE->>BE: Ambil kredensial dari database
    Note over BE: SSH Handler (Netmiko)
    BE->>Device: SSH Connect (IP:22)
    activate Device
    
    alt Koneksi Berhasil
        Device-->>BE: SSH Connection Success
        deactivate Device
        BE-->>FE: Return success message
        deactivate BE
        FE-->>NOC: Koneksi berhasil
        deactivate FE
    else Koneksi Gagal
        Device-->>BE: Connection Timeout/Refused
        deactivate Device
        BE-->>FE: Return error message
        deactivate BE
        FE-->>NOC: Koneksi gagal<br/>(timeout/auth failed/network error)
        deactivate FE
    end
